d cues, and fixes for a few enemies that weren't behaving as intended. Here's what's changed:- Spectral Shotgun: New orange projectiles with matching muzzle flashes and hit effects.- More sound cues: Bats now have movement, aggro, and attack sounds. The fireplace has an audible warning, and the cat statue hisses when it starts firing.- Enemy pursuit: I fixed an issue that kept the Studio Sentinel from resuming a chas","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-10T17:52:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067936889","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:24:28Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5094290-1844751498232393","game_id":"steam-5094290","kind":"announcement","title":"Haunted House Hellshift joins October Steam Next Fest","summary":"We’re joining Steam Next Fest! Haunted House Hellshift will be part of Steam Next Fest from October 19–26, and the free demo is already available! It’s a fast-paced arcade shooter set in a haunted house, with a TV audience watching you fight for the exit. Expect goofy monsters, traps, and eyeballs that open doors—more spooky cartoon fun than serious horror. Play solo or bring a friend for local two-player co-op. Give the demo a try, let me know what you think, and wishlist the game if you’d like","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-28T19:42:04Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498232393","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:24:28Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5094290":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-23T21:22:04Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-23T21:22:03Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5094290":"2026-10-23T21:22:04Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5094290":{"last_attempt_at":"20